{"summary":"Miracle Merchant is solitaire style potion brewing card game.","description":"In Miracle Merchant you become the apprentice of a master alchemist who creates potions for thirsty customers. By mixing and combining different ingredient cards you create powerful potions based on the needs of your customers.\n\nEach game has a unique, randomly generated set of cards that will test your skills. By successfully completing games you can collect a variety of masterfully crafted potions. Daily tasks will keep you busy and you can compete with other players via online leaderboards.\n\nFeatures \n+ Solitaire style gameplay \n+ 41 collectable potions\n+ Daily tasks\n+ Daily game with global highscores \n+ Mix and combine puzzle gameplay\n+ 2-3mins playtime per game\n\nVisit www.tinytouchtales.com & www.miracle-merchant.com","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $2.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mvId7WSISsg?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/w0wM9el2szNDBFNK3ZgL2G4Tl4MuZscoCZ_AflbUMI4KwiQGZF61qQQM2dAwb2zJExgdTrOQRt2Ml9d8fLX5ooU","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xSMwKOmeBFtiOn7dcFf6eYvXHjupMQdkmzncVFuhGz0a5rsm8P9qjaRAYh7WvOvW2tPYavHRsFjXhBD638dK","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6J-iRxmHi4D6eP1NWWjSfjWVdoHIBvNUKAog7E-kugCgWUkQBYz3lkXfJgkN52yByKo70aVgVL4x8QkGlZxOpQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zKbcXuvsj5dedQGJX999HVkP3u-Ir9WFEHl-bOUaJPFSGqGsposXGU-5n-cvy-RzOzQrEDAASak0w3YLfA38","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xWdVOgLPYEBnUopIo-ylQnkOmRdqATmg3qDs7kN7Wlo_fUie5MZ6r-a228ABOWC3krf6F5e_2SSgO4N-6uY1","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/K782ghuQIy1HOXmtkxQ0CqzkG9XyhjRYaXChTwHToQcYq43Tr0SNk7VuVAP_-FB5scS1qy2o1huxG6yUHJxgIJ8","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/894x3dY4akcT7Ic009v8eSxZNBZRX5OoRsefNaGDia9AYMoenSzY_9YPWNy8GgaT8Yy5b4oc8bkz5dxjq_o8Zg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vPuv6ND51LIsA3hZbWoHdrEEeSitA5oQD5pEWNKXK1MQS6IuUMW3R-tM